Query:
--Description: Quick count of how many customers will be excluded (zero-LTV) vs included.
WITH lifetime AS (
    SELECT 
        "customer_id", 
        SUM("amount") AS "total_ltv"
    FROM SQLITE_SAKILA.SQLITE_SAKILA.PAYMENT
    GROUP BY "customer_id"
)
SELECT 
    COUNT(*)                                                   AS "customers_with_ltv",
    SUM(CASE WHEN "total_ltv" = 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)          AS "zero_ltv_customers"
FROM lifetime
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
customers_with_ltv,zero_ltv_customers
